        <outline text="2020-07-10（金）【FIRSTGED】" _note="C-P：&lt;a href=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/album/9a708fddac59f6c0ef38dec2619bd500e354d7e8.jpg&quot;&gt;2478&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/album/54908eb17b7f52eb521d9ff8c44d4099b4daf593.gif&quot;&gt;2479&lt;/a&gt;" />
