        <outline text="2020-07-16（木）【FRNGED】" _note="C-P：2493（&lt;a href=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/album/62046eeb8854e3b26a2ebb5e95a07ad0f4759111.gif&quot;&gt;a1&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/album/ffa7c98ccbefaf178efbb64b0e1505167704d876.gif&quot;&gt;a2&lt;/a&gt;）、&lt;a href=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/album/91cacfdb4e77ef2418e8a2bce67048680d5dcb1d.jpg&quot;&gt;2494&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/album/87f5188aa4cb4588c76b976154e106672c99f570.jpg&quot;&gt;2495&lt;/a&gt;" />
