        <outline text="2020-07-18（土）【FIRNGED】" _note="C-P：&lt;a href=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/album/0a5fe10f7297ab6a31502a1d0e2112e8c45d7653.jpg&quot;&gt;2501&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/album/3b6f6c377495cdeb08ee1e848c957b296fcc036d.jpg&quot;&gt;2502&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/album/e361bbd08d4801995bc996920aa74a91123b444c.jpg&quot;&gt;2503&lt;/a&gt;" />
